# WhatsApp Chat Analyzer

WhatsApp Chat Analyzer is a visual analytics project that transforms WhatsApp chat data into meaningful insights 
such as popular words, response patterns,activity heatmaps, and personality archetypes, helping users understand their group communication patterns.

#Features
- Chat Parser
- Group Overview
- Word Frequency Analysis
- Activity Heatmap
- Response Time Analysis
- Silent Streak Analysis
- Personality Archetypes

